  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5920.03 Living Wills, Durable Powers of Attorney, and Patient Requested, Physician Generated Orders Relative to Resuscitation",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5920.03 Living Wills, Durable Powers of Attorney, and Patient Requested, Physician Generated Orders Relative to Resuscitation. All living wills, durable powers of attorney, and patient-requested, physician-generated orders relative to resuscitation shall be generated in accordance with the requirements set forth in RSA 137-J, pertaining to written directives for medical decision-making for adults without the capacity to make health care decisions.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at Chapter heading for Saf-C 5900) #12790, eff 5-24-19",
